# EEUCC Columbus — Project Overview

## What This Project Is

A bilingual (English / Amharic) church website for **Ethiopian Emmanuel United Church of Columbus (EEUCC)**. It is a React SPA deployed to Firebase Hosting with Firestore as the database and Firebase Auth for user management.

**Live domain context:** The church is at 1055 McNaughten Rd, Columbus, OH 43213. Sunday worship is 4:00 PM – 7:00 PM.

## Tech Stack

| Layer | Technology | Version |
|-------|-----------|---------|
| Framework | React | 19.x |
| Build tool | Vite | 7.x |
| Routing | react-router-dom | 7.x |
| Forms | react-hook-form | 7.x |
| UI components | @headlessui/react | 2.x |
| Icons | @heroicons/react | 2.x |
| Date formatting | date-fns | 4.x |
| Backend | Firebase (Auth, Firestore, Storage, Analytics) | 12.x |
| Hosting | Firebase Hosting | — |
| CI/CD | GitHub Actions | — |
| Language | JavaScript (JSX) — **no TypeScript** | — |

