## Context Providers (wrapping order)

`BrowserRouter` → `AuthProvider` → `LanguageProvider` → `SiteSettingsProvider` → `AppRoutes`

## Routing

| Path | Component | Auth? |
|------|-----------|-------|
| `/` | Home | No |
| `/about` | About | No |
| `/events` | Events | No |
| `/events/:id` | EventDetail | No |
| `/sermons` | Sermons | No |
| `/sermons/:id` | SermonDetail | No |
| `/contact` | Contact | No |
| `/give` | Give | No |
| `/login` | Login (no Layout) | No |
| `/register` | Register (no Layout) | No |
| `/profile-update` | ProfileUpdate | Yes (ProtectedRoute) |
| `/admin` | AdminDashboard (AdminLayout) | Yes (admin) |
| `/admin/church-info` | AdminChurchInfo | Yes (admin) |
| `/admin/events` | AdminEvents | Yes (admin) |
| `/admin/sermons` | AdminSermons | Yes (admin) |
| `/admin/giving` | AdminGiving | Yes (admin) |
| `/admin/youth` | AdminYouth | Yes (admin) |
| `/admin/messages` | AdminMessages | Yes (admin) |
| `*` | NotFound (404) | No |

Login and Register render **outside** the Layout (no Navbar/Footer).
Admin routes use `AdminLayout` (sidebar + `<Routes>`) inside the main Layout.

## Public navigation (Navbar)

- **Surface:** Light bar (`--navbar-bg`, aligned with `logo.png` canvas / `--color-bg-alt`); nav links and brand use primary/muted text; Sign In uses solid primary button.
- **Desktop:** `Home`, `About`, **Youth & Children** (top-level link), then Headless UI **`Menu`** dropdowns **Worship** (Sermons, Events) and **Connect** (Contact, Give), then optional **Complete Profile** / **Admin** when applicable; language is a pill toggle (EN / አማ), not a `<select>`.
- **≤1024px:** Primary nav collapses to a hamburger; the panel groups links under Main (includes Youth & Children) / Worship / Connect / Account with a backdrop and scroll lock.
- **Typography:** Google Fonts in `index.html` — **Cormorant Garamond** (`--font-display`) for headings/brand, **DM Sans** (`--font-sans`) for UI. Layout uses `--navbar-height` (sticky admin sidebar offset matches).

## Firestore Collections

| Collection | Public Read | Write |
|-----------|------------|-------|
| `users` | Own profile only | Owner creates; owner or admin updates |
| `events` | Yes | Admin only |
| `sermons` | Yes | Admin only |
| `contactMessages` | No | Anyone creates; admin manages |
| `prayerRequests` | No | Anyone creates; admin manages |
| `churchProfileUpdates` | No | Auth users create; admin manages |
| `siteSettings` | Yes | Admin only |
| `youthVideos` | Yes | Admin only |
| `youthPageContent` | Yes | Admin only |

## Bilingual Data Model

All user-visible Firebase content has bilingual (EN/AM) field pairs:
- **Events**: `title`/`titleAm`, `description`/`descriptionAm`, `details`/`detailsAm`, `location`/`locationAm`
- **Sermons**: `title`/`titleAm`, `description`/`descriptionAm`
- **churchInfo.serviceTimes[]**: `day`/`dayAm`, `note`/`noteAm`
- **churchInfo.beliefs[]**: `title`/`titleAm`, `desc`/`descAm`
- **churchInfo.values[]**: `icon` (Heroicons key from `src/utils/valueIcons.js`; legacy emoji strings still map until admin save), `title`/`titleAm`, `desc`/`descAm`
- **churchInfo**: `missionStatement`/`missionStatementAm`, `storyPara1`/`storyPara1Am`, `storyPara2`/`storyPara2Am`, optional `pastorName`/`pastorNameAm` (Home pastoral contact card)
- **givingSettings.funds[]**: `label`/`labelAm`, `desc`/`descAm`
- **givingSettings**: `scriptureText`/`scriptureTextAm`, `scriptureCite`/`scriptureCiteAm`, `plannedGivingText`/`plannedGivingTextAm`
- **youthPageContent/main**: bilingual `*En` / `*Am` string fields for hero, intro, stats, ministry cards, section titles, CTA, empty video copy; `faqs[]` with `questionEn`/`questionAm`, `answerEn`/`answerAm`
- **youthVideos**: `title`/`titleAm`, `description`/`descriptionAm` (plus `url`, metadata, `thumbnailUrl`, `sortOrder`)

Rendering pattern: `const am = language === 'am'; const display = am && item.titleAm ? item.titleAm : item.title;`

## User Roles

- `member` — default role on registration, stored in `users/{uid}.role`
- `admin` — can write events/sermons, manage all collections, access admin panel

## Environment Variables

All prefixed with `VITE_FIREBASE_` and accessed via `import.meta.env`:
- `VITE_FIREBASE_API_KEY`
- `VITE_FIREBASE_AUTH_DOMAIN`
- `VITE_FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID`
- `VITE_FIREBASE_STORAGE_BUCKET`
- `VITE_FIREBASE_MESSAGING_SENDER_ID`
- `VITE_FIREBASE_APP_ID`
- `VITE_FIREBASE_MEASUREMENT_ID`

Optional: `VITE_CLIENT_INTAKE_FORM_URL` (was used on Contact page; now removed from UI).

Optional: `VITE_HERO_YOUTUBE_VIDEO_ID` — 11-character YouTube video ID for the Home page hero background video (embed via `youtube-nocookie.com`). If unset, a built-in default scenic B-roll is used; override per environment or edit `DEFAULT_HERO_YOUTUBE_VIDEO_ID` in `src/pages/Home.jsx`.

## Key Commands

```bash
npm run dev      # Start Vite dev server
npm run build    # Production build → dist/
npm run preview  # Preview production build
npm run lint     # ESLint check
```
